From: Christian Marangi <ansuelsmth@gmail.com>
To: Vinod Koul <vkoul@kernel.org>,
	Neil Armstrong <neil.armstrong@linaro.org>,
	Lorenzo Bianconi <lorenzo@kernel.org>,
